    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like you're not listening to how heavy it is. people talk about \"light\" and \"steps\" but it feels like a cruel joke when you're already dead inside. sometimes i think the only way to actually find peace or some kind of quiet is to just... not be here anymore. like, wouldn't it be easier if the struggle just stopped entirely? if i didn't have to wake up to this every single morning?",
